# SPI Multi-IO driver configuration
#

config SPI_MULTI_IO
	tristate "SPI Multi-IO (DI/DO/AI/AO) support"
	depends on SPI
	help
	  SPI-to-multi-interface driver supporting two module types
	  over a single chip-select SPI bus:

	    Type1 - 8x Digital Input (DI) + 8x Digital Output (DO)
	    Type2 - 4x Analog Input (AI) + 2x Analog Output (AO)

	  Modules share one SPI bus and one CS line, differentiated
	  by assigned addresses. Features:
	    - Automatic module discovery and address assignment
	    - sysfs interface for DI/DO/AI/AO access
	    - Optional power-gpios for module power cycling
	      to guarantee reliable scan
	    - Power management (suspend/resume with state restore)

	  Device tree compatible: "hqvt,spi-multi-io"

	  Say M here to build as a module (spi_multi_io.ko).
